Subject: [PATCH] mips: mt7628: add Tuoshi LT22M full-NOR bootloader variant

Provide the full 16-MiB SPI-NOR layout, dual uImage magic and no empty
command repetition. Override inherited bootcmd with checked NOR boot,
and import the validated Factory LAN MAC in RAM even if ethaddr exists.
Support reset-button TFTP initramfs recovery in RAM with bounded uploads.
Light all six front LEDs during U-Boot as on stock; retain the existing
mobile-LED error and TFTP patterns, turn all off before kernel handoff.
Never write Factory or env. Use 20-MHz SPI reads, retaining 1 MHz for
environment loading. CRC is not authentication: use a trusted LAN.
This does not install or flash U-Boot on any device.

---

